---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy — UnitConverter">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto py-8 sm:py-12 md:py-20">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="mb-12 sm:mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-canvas-soft-2 text-[11px] font-mono text-mute uppercase tracking-widest mb-6">
        Legal
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em] text-ink mb-5 sm:mb-6 leading-tight">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-body leading-relaxed">
        Last updated: January 1, 2025
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="space-y-8 text-body leading-relaxed">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink mb-3">1. Introduction</h2>
        <p>
          Welcome to UnitConverter. We respect your privacy and are committed to protecting your personal data. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your information when you visit our website.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink mb-3">2. Information We Collect</h2>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-ink mb-2">2.1 Personal Data</h3>
        <p>
          We do not require you to create an account or provide personal information to use our conversion tools. However, if you contact us via our contact form or email, we may collect your name, email address, and any other information you choose to provide.
        </p>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-ink mt-4 mb-2">2.2 Usage Data</h3>
        <p>
          We may automatically collect certain information when you visit our website, including your IP address, browser type, operating system, referring URLs, and pages you view. This information helps us improve our services and understand usage patterns.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink mb-3">3. Cookies and Advertising</h2>
        <p>
          Our website uses cookies and similar tracking technologies to enhance your browsing experience. Cookies are small text files stored on your device. We use cookies for:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-1">
          <li>Remembering your theme preference (light/dark mode)</li>
          <li>Analyzing site traffic and usage patterns (via Google Analytics)</li>
          <li>Serving relevant advertisements (via Google AdSense)</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Google, as a third-party vendor, uses cookies to serve ads on our site. Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to our users based on their visit to our site and/or other sites on the Internet.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Users may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting the <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary hover:underline">Google Ads Settings</a> page. Alternatively, you can opt out of a third-party vendor's use of cookies for personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.aboutads.info" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary hover:underline">www.aboutads.info</a>.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          You can also control cookies through your browser settings. Disabling cookies may affect certain features of our website.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink mb-3">4. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>We use the collected information for the following purposes:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-1">
          <li>To provide, operate, and maintain our website and conversion tools</li>
          <li>To improve, personalize, and expand our services</li>
          <li>To understand and analyze how you use our website</li>
          <li>To communicate with you, including responding to your inquiries</li>
          <li>To detect, prevent, and address technical issues</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink mb-3">5. Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>
          We do not sell, trade, or otherwise transfer your personally identifiable information to third parties. We use standard third-party services to improve the website's performance and monetization:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-1">
          <li><strong>Google Analytics:</strong> We use Google Analytics to monitor and analyze web traffic. Google collects visitor data and usage stats to generate reports on site usage.</li>
          <li><strong>Google AdSense:</strong> We display ads served by Google AdSense. AdSense uses personalization cookies to customize advertising based on your interests and search history.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink mb-3">6. Data Security</h2>
        <p>
          We implement appropriate technical and organizational measures to protect your personal data. However, no method of transmission over the Internet or electronic storage is 100% secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink mb-3">7. Your Rights</h2>
        <p>Depending on your location, you may have the following rights regarding your personal data:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-1">
          <li>The right to access, update, or delete your information</li>
          <li>The right to rectification if your data is inaccurate</li>
          <li>The right to object to processing of your personal data</li>
          <li>The right to data portability</li>
          <li>The right to withdraw consent at any time</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink mb-3">8. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of any changes by posting the new Privacy Policy on this page and updating the "Last updated" date.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink mb-3">9. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>
          If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at <a href="mailto:support@realunitconverter.com" class="text-primary hover:underline">support@realunitconverter.com</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
